.TH KINTSUGI-KB 1 "2026-10-22" "kintsugi 0.8.0" "Kintsugi Manual"
.SH NAME
kintsugi-kb \- knowledge base management
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B kintsugi kb
build <stix> <out>
.br
.B kintsugi kb
reindex <dir>
.br
.B kintsugi kb
search <dir> "<query>" [\-\-top N]
.br
.B kintsugi kb
list <dir>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Manage knowledge bases built from MITRE CTI STIX bundles.
.SH COMMANDS
.IP \fBbuild\fR
Build a KB from a STIX bundle
.IP \fBreindex\fR
Rebuild the derived BM25 index
.IP \fBsearch\fR
Rank chunks with BM25
.IP \fBlist\fR
Show base id/version/title and chunk count
.SH OPTIONS
.IP \fB\-\-top\fR
Number of results (search, default 8)
.SH EXAMPLES
Build a knowledge base:
.PP
  $ kintsugi kb build bundle.json kb/
.PP
Rebuild index:
.PP
  $ kintsugi kb reindex kb/
.PP
Search:
.PP
  $ kintsugi kb search kb/ "lateral movement"
.PP
List KB contents:
.PP
  $ kintsugi kb list kb/
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR kintsugi (1)
